<title>SINGAPORE: Summers encouraged U.S inflation under control.</title>
<headline>Summers encouraged U.S inflation under control.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Deputy Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers said on Friday he was encouraged that U.S. inflation is under control.</p>
<p>&quot;I have been very encouraged as...economic expansion has taken place by how well under control inflation seems to have remained,&quot; Summers told a news conference in Singapore.</p>
</text>
